    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf4a4e3cbcb291573489c772",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不可思议的事情正在接连发生。\r\n这一切都和她的那个『朋友』有关系吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c756ff95e9e0403e02c1dc9cda5932d7dfc2cdc2ec1aa2e85bcb78294db0626",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
