    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e32b5598a4bbc1a97957f2f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然在意的事情依旧还有很多，但现在——\r\n最让我印象深刻的，却是她那强到足以称得上恐怖的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "293298046591ea0c3bbfa791bd91eee359400427f03de98b7d2bcd73cd41e570",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
