      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——之后过了好几天。\r\n我每天晚上都会去操场给予曼城茶座一些训练的建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4d43cafd3f12f40c3acb89a4cc0bfb1aadf8ddf4105c66e1ee58e10cb9b0d7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
