    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d5ff3664f629a562ba93f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在此期间，我经历了诸如打开门后看见一堵墙、\r\n书架上的书莫名其妙砸到我头上、电视机突然自己打开之类的怪事。\r\n不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a70f8548dee65154f66e8293b0e2649df05cc112d73b134d054c84ca377d21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
