      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个……今天的她……感觉……充满野性呢……\r\n总觉得……干劲充足到要溢出来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69c1167740ad7b8ea1ffeb1c53d0ea6dd6b7135b058b4ddd899ec81804be55c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
