      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说是时候发掘马娘了……但是压根找不到合适的对象啊。\r\n你呢？有人选了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b46fb18f910359b3a81452314081a4a78ec647b59891ec10d16e40c3cb4622",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
