      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:855ebc2157cdb7deff82d6fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "连着看了好几天曼城茶座的训练，\r\n我已经在考虑要不要和她签约了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72b87dae2326999397d41f3b134af6e483f1cd294d0053f811c1d39543b985e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f0253a4be43cd9e5ee82604",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不过，我看不见她的那位『朋友』。\r\n不知道她能不能接受看不见她『朋友』的训练员呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "08f3233cddece502fddb7752eb97e647f3937057f3d9afb493890859098f4e12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1025/storytimeline_041025003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:464f1d826744a505da6cf407",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……哼，正好省了我去关灯。\r\n我这样想着，迈步走向操场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29bcc50aa4bcfd73f56816783f43c80f18c5b7da1bf4c48d5c9b351702466834",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
